title OpenData Build, Documentation and Release Pipeline

start
:Developer pushes commit or opens pull request;
fork
  :Build and quality workflow;
  :Set up Java 24 and Maven cache;
  :Run clean verify;
  :Publish test and quality reports;
fork again
  :Documentation validation workflow;
  :Validate manifest, sources and links;
  :Build HTML manuals with Pandoc;
  :Publish documentation artifact;
end fork
if (Tagged release vX.Y.Z?) then (yes)
  :Verify tag matches pom.xml version;
  :Run strict quality verification;
  :Build JAR and source ZIP;
  :Generate SHA-256 checksums;
  :Publish GitHub Release;
else (no)
  :Complete CI checks;
endif
stop
@enduml
